            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/540740/extras/bcb4eac5009a3d7433b48f063fb3fc11.webp?t=1578305001\" width=600 height=36 /></span><br><br>Perfect é a verdadeira essência da fuga em realidade virtual. Deixa a rotina diária para trás, e escapa para vários destinos lindíssimos e relaxantes, desde praias banhadas pelo sol, à espetacular aurora boreal. Acessível instantaneamente e sempre cativante, Perfect é o companheiro ideal para exibires o teu equipamento de realidade virtual.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/540740/extras/f442454d32329d4ecdfd9bc3f8a9f397.avif?t=1578305001\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/540740/extras/815091239fdbd253e81395466472cc07.webp?t=1578305001\" width=600 height=36 /></span><br><br>Paisagens maravilhosas e controlos simples tornam o Perfect numa forma ideal de experienciar as maravilhas da realidade virtual.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/540740/extras/4c2974b196e053f2726d125211552598.avif?t=1578305001\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/540740/extras/0e261ddd2af0dd7907e33c2fdc484d29.webp?t=1578305001\" width=600 height=36 /></span><br><br>Descobre três cenários diferentes, Praia Tropical, Aurora Boreal e Floresta Montanhosa. Escolhe entre diferentes alturas do dia e pontos de visualização para encontrares o teu local perfeito.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/540740/extras/33d07c4324d822e5309108b6f1b7ecc6.avif?t=1578305001\" width=600 height=335 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/540740/extras/258ecd523d2c4e18b2193e63718498c6.webp?t=1578305001\" width=600 height=36 /></span><br><br>Mergulha em ambientes naturais e descobre momentos especiais que tornarão a tua visita inesquecível. Depois recosta-te, relaxa e ouve música.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/540740/extras/4b303350f0bc6ad97f820b448d8bbac2.avif?t=1578305001\" width=600 height=250 /></span>",
